 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:9787a",
   "off": 620666,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "大門の番兵\r",
   "en": "Great Gate Guard\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:97887",
   "off": 620679,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「大門の通行は 日中に\r  制限されている\u0010\b  今日は もう閉鎖した\r  から 宿を探すことだな」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Passage through the Great Gate is only allowed by day.\u0010\bIt's closed for today, so you'd best find an inn.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:978e5",
   "off": 620773,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "番兵\r",
   "en": "Guard\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:978ec",
   "off": 620780,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「この辺に怪物が現れた\r  という通報があった\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"We've had a report of a monster around here.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:9791b",
   "off": 620827,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  とりあえず､調査が\r  終わるまでここは封鎖だ\u0010\b",
   "en": "This area's sealed off until the investigation's over.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:9794b",
   "off": 620875,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  お前さんには\r  気の毒だが…」\u0010\b",
   "en": "Sorry for your trouble, but there it is...\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:97972",
   "off": 620914,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "フィン\r",
   "en": "Finn\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:9797b",
   "off": 620923,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「まいったな…\u0010\b  こんな夜更けに\r  どうしろってんだ？」\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Great...\u0010\bWhat am I supposed to do this late at night?\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:979ba",
   "off": 620986,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "乞食\r",
   "en": "Beggar\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:979c9",
   "off": 621001,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「貴族のおこぼれでも\r  頂戴しようと思って\u0010\b  さっき､東地区に行って\r  きたんですがね\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Thought I'd go scrounge some scraps off the nobles,\u0010\bso I popped over to the East District just now.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:97a20",
   "off": 621088,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  幸い番兵どもは例に\r  よって酔いつぶれて\r  眠っているし…\u0010\b",
   "en": "Luckily, the guards were dead drunk and asleep, as usual...\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:97a5e",
   "off": 621150,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  丁度､門を通る時に\r  銀色の髪の娘に\r  ぶつかっちまってね\u0010\b",
   "en": "And right as I went through the gate, I bumped into a girl with silver hair.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:97a9b",
   "off": 621211,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  番兵が目を覚ます\r  んじゃないかって\r  ヒヤヒヤしたよ\u0010\b",
   "en": "Had me sweatin' the guards'd wake up.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:97ad5",
   "off": 621269,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  えらい勢いで東地区へ\r  すっとんでいったが\r  大丈夫かね？」\u0010\b",
   "en": "She went flyin' off into the East District like a shot. Hope she's all right.\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:97b1e",
   "off": 621342,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「東地区はぶっそうだから\r  娘一人で大丈夫かね？」\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"The East District's a rough place. Will a girl on her own be all right?\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:97b5f",
   "off": 621407,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "番兵\r",
   "en": "Guard\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:97b66",
   "off": 621414,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「いま 反逆者の狩り出し\r  を行っている\u0010\b  この地区から移動しては\r  いかん！」\u0010",
   "en": "\"We're rounding up rebels right now.\u0010\bYou may not leave this district!\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:97bbf",
   "off": 621503,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "番兵\r",
   "en": "Guard\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:97bc6",
   "off": 621510,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「夜は宿へ帰って\r  出歩かないことだな」\u0010",
   "en": "\"At night, you'd best get back to your inn and stay off the streets.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:97bf8",
   "off": 621560,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "この酒場は 閉まっている\u0010",
   "en": "This tavern is closed.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES01:97c14",
   "off": 621588,
   "op": "22",
